WEBVTT

00:00:00.150 --> 00:00:02.240
Two enzymes, one bare template.

00:00:02.867 --> 00:00:04.283
Who can start a new strand?

00:00:04.910 --> 00:00:06.721
DNA polymerase tries first.

00:00:07.255 --> 00:00:08.022
Nothing happens.

00:00:08.416 --> 00:00:09.682
It can only add to a strand

00:00:09.728 --> 00:00:10.854
that's already started.

00:00:11.481 --> 00:00:12.828
Now primase tries.

00:00:13.223 --> 00:00:14.790
It starts from scratch with a short

00:00:14.895 --> 00:00:15.788
RNA primer.

00:00:16.323 --> 00:00:17.484
Primase is the starter.

00:00:18.110 --> 00:00:19.573
Polymerase is the builder.

00:00:20.200 --> 00:00:22.557
Now polymerase adds DNA onto the primer.

00:00:23.184 --> 00:00:24.577
Now try the question again.
